{"4483860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Footsteps in the Dark", "steam_appid": 4483860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483860/extras/439b01c729e8e48a753207063c284046.avif?t=1772953908\" width=1560 height=300 /></span><strong>1v4 First-Person Asymmetric Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt as a hunter</strong> and complete the final ritual - <strong>or hunt as the monster</strong> and break the team before the ritual is done.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483860/extras/84982217638cf6c8736fa474de86e31a.avif?t=1772953908\" width=1560 height=300 /></span><strong>Sound &amp; Tension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every sound is a signal.</strong> Footsteps, doors, and moving props reveal you and spark panic when silence matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483860/extras/ca882e81de85dc0d3d4ba017c98eb681.avif?t=1772953908\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Investigation, Ritual, Kill</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive by solving the hunt.</strong> Identify the creature’s weakness,  gather required tools, and complete the final ritual before the hunter becomes the hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483860/extras/724e45467e44f70ae53d2d89e96abbaf.avif?t=1772953908\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Monster</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’re not just chasing you're controlling the pace.</strong> Stalk, separate the team, deny objectives, and strike before hunters commit the ritual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483860/extras/b15bd13fc2e91d31a74c70a12b2655aa.avif?t=1772953908\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural Horror Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a different nightmare every match.</strong> Mansions, forests, and tombs shift their layout, routes, and hiding spots forcing hunters to adapt and keeping the monster’s moves unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483860/extras/39f052ca665454557334a8ff4f34bb09.avif?t=1772953908\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interactive Tools &amp; Props</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use the environment to win.</strong> Barricade, distract, lure, improvise  and turn objects into survival tactics or tools for the ritual.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483860/extras/439b01c729e8e48a753207063c284046.avif?t=1772953908\" width=1560 height=300 /></span><strong>1v4 First-Person Asymmetric Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt as a hunter</strong> and complete the final ritual - <strong>or hunt as the monster</strong> and break the team before the ritual is done.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4483860/extras/84982217638cf6c8736fa474de86e31a.avif?t=1772953908\" width=1560 height=300 /></span><strong>Sound &amp; Tension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><str